C2 on every int fold op at range edges (wrap, sat, signed shr, shl.wrap masking, bit counts of 0, bool logic, compares of mathematical values, casts, select), each result compared with its expected constant so a wrong fold keeps the trap branch; folds that would trap (overflow, division by 0, MIN / -1, MIN % -1, neg MIN, shift amount out of range) stay, as do float ops; canon drops the types only the folded code used.
